{"pageid":4153,"title":"Freyliner Transporter Upgrade","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Freyliner Transporter Upgrade</span>","revid":19635,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Freyliner Transporter Upgrade</b> was added on June 7th of 2025. It adds a box onto pre-existing trailer to the <a href=\"/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter\" title=\"Freyliner Transporter\">Freyliner Transporter</a>. This <b>item</b> used to be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_Auto\" title=\"Alan&#39;s Auto\">Alans Auto</a> for $95,000 (first-release). As of July 2025 (a month later), the price has went down and now costs $25,000.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>\nThe box upgrade of Freyliner is the first box vehicle in the game (coming later is the Golf Cart), allowing player to stores without worrying things will get flipped or fly away. The box has door, player are advised to close the door for best storage security while transporting.</p><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"65447014a439cfce26daf5026c045971\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:57px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Box_truck-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:55px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Box_truck.png\" title=\"Box truck.png (302 KB)\" style=\"height:55px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Box_truck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250926182727\" title=\"Box truck.png (302 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The box upgrade from the Freyliner Transporter\" height=\"55\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Box truck.png\" data-